#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:8
msgid ""
"Curriculum terms change an environment as training progresses. Pass these "
"helpers to :class:`~isaaclab.managers.CurriculumTermCfg`:"
msgstr "课程项随着训练进展改变环境。将以下辅助项传入 :class:`~isaaclab.managers.CurriculumTermCfg`："

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:11
msgid ":func:`modify_reward_weight` changes a reward's weight."
msgstr ":func:`modify_reward_weight` 修改奖励权重。"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:12
