msgstr "curriculum 工具的完整源代码"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:23
msgid "Modifying Reward Weights"
msgstr "修改奖励权重"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:25
msgid ""
"The function :func:`modify_reward_weight` updates the weight of a reward "
"term after a specified number of simulation steps. This can be passed "
"directly as the ``func`` in a ``CurriculumTermCfg``."
msgstr ""
"函数 :func:`modify_reward_weight` 在指定的仿真步数后更新奖励项的权重。这可以直接作为 "
"``CurriculumTermCfg`` 中的 ``func`` 传递。"

